&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Following the neutralization of SCP-4704, clearance requisites for access to this file have been lifted by &lt;strong&gt;The O5 Council&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;The Records And Information Security Administration&lt;/strong&gt; on 02\29\2016&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedure:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: blue&quot;&gt;All research personnel assigned to Area-92 are required to possess a copy of the &lt;em&gt;4704-Position to Tone Relation Guide Volume 5&lt;/em&gt; as supplied by on site database. Activation of instances for use in the Delta Enclosure Project requires Level 5-Δ clearance and authorization of 4704 Lead Researcher. Personnel assigned to Area-92 must regularly undergo a reality-dissonance psych assessment.&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-303758-9&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;9&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; Personnel given Level 4/5-Δ clearance must take a RPR Examination&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-303758-10&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;10&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; and undergo a 1 month background check of antecedent assignments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: blue&quot;&gt;SCP-4704-ö̀ has been given authorization to operate as a consultant during the construction of additional ████████ ██████████ ██████████ (███).&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-303758-11&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;11&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: blue&quot;&gt;SCP-4704-ö̀ has shown to be capable of altering the cellular composition of itself to an unlimited degree, changing its corporeal form often. Its forms usually consist of local wild life, and a human male of seemingly Latin American descent. SCP-4704-ö̀ has also been able to adeptly learn a multitude of modern languages and expressions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
