&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-303758-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. See &lt;em&gt;Addendum 4704.01: Test Log-064&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-303758-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. Spanish cedar&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-303758-4&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;4&lt;/a&gt;. Gallinazo tree&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-303758-5&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;5&lt;/a&gt;. See &lt;em&gt;Addendum 4704.01: Incident Report 4704-ö̀&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-303758-6&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;6&lt;/a&gt;. white-headed capuchin&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-303758-7&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;7&lt;/a&gt;. See Addendum 4704.02: Findings Report&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-303758-8&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;8&lt;/a&gt;. See Addendum 4704.01: Containment Committee Proposal&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-303758-9&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;9&lt;/a&gt;. See MD Publication: &lt;em&gt;Reality Bent: The Adverse Effects On Mental Health When Exposed To Hume Field Discrepancy&lt;/em&gt; pp 002-017&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-303758-10&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;10&lt;/a&gt;. Reality Perception Resistance Examination; See MD Publication: &lt;em&gt;Reality Bent: The Adverse Effects On Mental Health When Exposed To Hume Field Discrepancy&lt;/em&gt; pp 304-330&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-303758-11&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;11&lt;/a&gt;. See &lt;em&gt;Addendum 4704.02: Delta Enclosure Project Briefing And Test Log&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
